    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a bit of a blunt assessment on the Africa side. Can you expand on that? When you say \"lack of work ethic,\" are you basing that on specific economic data or is it more about the cultural attitude toward professional environments in those regions? I need to know if I'm looking at a training issue or just a fundamental difference in how people approach labor there.",
